FreeBSD syscall dispatch support for wine-proton 11.0-2 (Proton's Wine,
ValveSoftware/wine tag proton-wine-11.0-2), the Wine side of
procctl_syscall_dispatch.patch; see procctl_syscall_dispatch.md.

Port of upstream Wine commits cbb9906d ("ntdll: Implement syscall
emulation on Linux using Syscall User Dispatch") and b90cdc04d77
("ntdll: Disable syscall dispatch when loading a .so dll") to FreeBSD:
procctl(PROC_SYSCALL_DISPATCH_CTL) instead of prctl(), libsys.so.7 as the
allowed range instead of libc.so.6.

Relative to the sources with the emulators/wine-proton port's other
patches applied (in the port, these changes are part of
files/patch-dlls_ntdll_unix_signal__x86__64.c,
files/patch-dlls_ntdll_unix_loader.c and
files/patch-dlls_ntdll_unix_unix__private.h).  Apply with patch -p1.

